      "type": "mcq",
      "marks": 1,
      "q": "The value of $\\left(\\dfrac{1+i}{\\sqrt2}\\right)^8+\\left(\\dfrac{1-i}{\\sqrt2}\\right)^8$ is :",
      "options": [
        "8",
        "4",
        "2",
