      "q": "If $|z|=1$, then the value of $\\dfrac{1+z}{1+\\bar z}$ is :",
      "options": [
        "$\\dfrac1z$",
        "$z$",
        "1",
        "$\\bar z$"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "solution": "$|z|=1\\Rightarrow\\bar z=\\dfrac1z$. $\\dfrac{1+z}{1+\\frac1z}=\\dfrac{z(1+z)}{z+1}=z$."
